flowchart TB
    subgraph Developer workstation
      H1[Signed editor hooks]
      H2[MeshAgent CLI]
      H3[MCP server with delegated read scope]
      Q[Encrypted, locked local delivery queue]
      H1 --> Q
      H3 --> Q
      H2 --> Q
    end

    subgraph Customer trust boundary
      IG[TLS ingress + OIDC]
      API[MeshAgent API and policy enforcement]
      W[Ingestion workers]
      PG[(Postgres control state, idempotency, jobs)]
      HM[(HyperMesh governed relationships)]
      CS[(Encrypted content store)]
      EV[(Immutable evidence and audit store)]
      OBS[Logs, metrics, traces, alerts]
      SCAN[Trusted scanner and CI attestations]
      OSV[Advisory cache and OSV]

      IG --> API
      API --> W
      W --> PG
      W --> HM
      W --> CS
      API --> EV
      API --> OBS
      W --> OBS
      SCAN --> API
      OSV --> API
    end

    Q --> IG
    UI[Developer and CISO web UI] --> IG
